<section id="A1.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.2 </span>Hint Retrieval Prompt</h3>

<div id="A1.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Below are the prompts used in retrieval, they were designed to also account for usage mid-episode, but we ended up not using that functionality as it would increase token usage.</p>
</div>
