<section id="A1.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.3 </span>Agent Prompt</h3>

<div id="A1.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Below are the prompts used for the main agent. It provides the agent with its task and few-shot examples, and includes a hint block (if using RAG). If evaluating without hints, the lines are removed from ”Here are some hints:” until the separators ”=============”.</p>
</div>
